        "text": "=I will provide you with specific data about customer which were just one step away from doing the payment and finalizing the order of products on Shopify. You will make a customized email including the name of a product and name of a client. You will write email to make him remember ordering that product.\nNo need mention those values that wont be necessary for the customer(like checkoutID, etc) and if the image URLs aren't working then just ignore them.\n\n---\n\ncheckoutID : {{ $json.checkout_id }}\ncustomersEmail : {{ $json.email }}\nFirst_name : {{ $json.customer.first_name }}\nLast_name : {{ $json.customer.last_name }}\nabandoned_checkout_url : {{ $json.abandoned_checkout_url }}\n\ntotal_price_of_cart : {{ $json.total_price }}{{ $json.currency }}\n\nproduct1TITLE : {{ $json.line_items[0].title }}\nquantity1 : {{ $json.line_items[0].quantity }}\nprice_of_product1 : {{ $json.line_items[0].price }}\nimage_url1 : {{ $json.line_items[0].image_url }}\n\nproduct2TITLE : {{ $json.line_items[1].title }}\nquantity2 : {{ $json.line_items[1].quantity }}\nprice_of_product2 : {{ $json.line_items[1].price }}\nimage_url2 : {{ $json.line_items[1].image_url }}\n\n",
